w: tem-pled hills; My heart* with* rap-ture thrills Like* that a-bove.
w: breathe par-take; Let rocks* their* si-lence break, The* sound pro-long.
w: ho-ly light; Pro-tect* us* by Thy might, Great* God, our King.
