X:133
T: Birds Are Singing
C: Jesca
Q: "Allegretto."
%R: air, waltz
B: "The Everyday Song Book", 1927
F: http://www.library.pitt.edu/happybirthday/pdf/The_Everyday_Song_Book.pdf
