T: DA MILL
S: Christopher Ritch, Baltasound
R: reel
B: Haand me doon da fiddle, 1979
Z: 2012 John Chambers <jc:trillian.mit.edu>
N: The repeat signs are only at the ends of phrases, and are a bit unclear.
