Dis is wan o' da first t\"uns I learned fae me grandfaider.  He
never kent da name o't but I caa it "Da Hamnavoe Polka" cause
dat wis whaur he bedd.  I never heard it ony wye else ootside
o' Eshaness.
%%endtext

