X:801
T: Jenny Lind
R: polka
Z: 1998 by John Chambers <jc@trillian.mit.edu>
N:
N: Morris Ring (several versions)
N:
N: Jenny Lind was a very popular singer from Sweden in the late 1800s.  Several tunes were written
N: for her.  This one was played all over Europe, and a great many variations of it exist.  This
N: two-key version is common, as are versions entirely in G or D.
