w: Bless-ed Je-sus, Bless-ed Je-sus, Hear, oh, hear us when we pray.
w: Bless-ed Je-sus, Bless-ed Je-sus, We will ear-ly turn to Thee.
w: Bless-ed Je-sus, Bless-ed Je-sus, Thou hast loved us, love us still.
